      "writtenOn": "2026-01-08T23:22:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`log4j-1.2-api` is a compatibility layer that implements the Log4j 1.2 API on top of Log4j 2, so keeping it does not reintroduce Log4j 1 itself.\n\nThat said, Gerrit core no longer uses the Log4j 1 API. I was able to remove this dependency and run a number of tests without observing any issues, which suggests that neither Gerrit core nor its core plugins and transitive dependencies rely on Log4j 1 anymore.\n\nGiven this, it may be worth considering removing this dependency, or at least adding a TODO comment to revisit it later once we are confident it is no longer needed.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 105,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 109,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "06e6113d8fb9e7242ac14974475a0425ae5fa51d",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
